  "title": {
   "en": "Shadow Assassins World ~Kage wa Usui kedo, Saikyou Ninja Yattemasu~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "シャドウ・アサシンズ・ワールド～影は薄いけど、最強忍者やってます～"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Kisaragi Saya is a lonely, gloomy high school girl who is cursed to never be noticed by those around her, almost like a ghost. During her first summer in high school, Saya discovers the full-dive VRMMORPG \"Shadow Assassin's World,\" changing her world forever. Even in the game, amidst a world monsters, demons, and other players, Saya finds that her presence is still nearly undetectable - so she decides to turn her curse into a blessing to become the top-class Ninja, \"Kuro!\" One day, an extroverted Ninja named \"Hikari\" crashes into her life and asks to be her apprentice! What lies ahead for this pair of polar opposites?",
   "ja": "もはや呪いとまで言えるほどの影の薄さを持つ、ぼっちで陰キャ女子高生・如月小夜（きさらぎ さや）。高校1年生の夏休み、暇つぶしにMMORPG≪シャドウ・アサシンズ・ワールド≫をプレイした小夜は、魔獣や妖怪が跋扈（ばっこ）する≪シャドアサ≫の世界でも持ち前の影の薄さを発揮し、≪忍者≫クラスの一流プレイヤー『クロ』として、その存在感を放ち始めた。そんなクロのもとに弟子入りを志願する陽キャ忍者・ヒカリが現れて――！？"
  },
